# git archive follows core.autocrlf, which turned EVERY file into CRLF in a bundle built on
# Windows - a CRLF shell script dies on Linux/macOS ("$'\r': command not found"). Pin the
# ending each platform actually needs so a bundle is byte-identical whoever builds it.
*.sh        text eol=lf
bin/locadev text eol=lf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
